<title>JAPAN: BOJ says sees April-June M2+CD growth around 3 pct.</title>
<headline>BOJ says sees April-June M2+CD growth around 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan said on Friday that it expects Japan's broadly defined money supply average of M2 plus certificates of deposit (CDs) for the April-June quarter to grow about three percent year on year.</p>
<p>M2+CDs grew a preliminary 3.0 percent year on year in the January-March period.</p>
